telligible pronunciation."}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": " Communicates effectively in English about the communicative topics for this level through the use of appropriate vocabulary and grammatical structures, and with intelligible pronunciation."}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": " Communicates effectively in English about the communicative topics for this level through the use of appropriate vocabulary and grammatical structures, and with intelligible pronunciation."}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": " Identifies general aspects of personal information in short written or spoken conversations."}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Verbs with Infinitives"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "Some verbs are followed by the <span class=\"strong\">infinitive form</span> of another verb  (to + verb). Some of these verbs are:<br /> <br/><span class=\"italic\">prefer (to go) </span> <br /><span class=\"italic\">plan (to visit)</span> <br /><span class=\"italic\">promise (to wait)</span> <br /><span class=\"italic\">want (to see)</span>"}, {"type": "example", "content": "We are planning to go to Comic Con."}, {"type": "example", "content": "I'd prefer to go by train."}, {"type": "example", "content": "I promise to get you a ticket."}, {"type": "example", "content": "We want to drive to Comic Con."}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": " Pastimes Around the World"}, {"type": "describer", "content": " "}, {"type": "text", "content": "In North America, people like to travel as a hobby or pastime. They travel to different cities or to different countries. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "In Asia, people travel less to other countries. They prefer to travel between different cities."}, {"type": "text", "content": "In Europe, people travel by train between different countries. It is easy to travel by train. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "What about in your country? Do people travel as a hobby?"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "How long does it take? "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "use this to ask how much time something takes"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: <span class=\"strong\">Mia</span>: How long does the bus ride take?<br/><span class=\"strong\">Julian</span>: It takes 20 minutes."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le02ob07aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": " These are words you use to talk about plans."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "discounted "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a lower special price"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Are there any discounted tickets for the convention?"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le02ob07aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "stand "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a small, open store at a convention"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: My work has a stand at the convention."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le02ob07aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "excited "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to feel happy about something that is happening soon"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I am excited about Comic Con!"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le02ob07aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to promise"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to tell someone that you will definitely do something"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": " (verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I promise to buy you lunch today."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le02ob07aud05"}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn3le02ob07re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Choose a place to visit with your friend."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Make plans for how to get there (train, bus, etc.)."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Write a short dialogue (5-6 lines)."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Practice the dialogue with your partner."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I write a dialogue to plan for a day trip."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I talk about what I prefer or want to do."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I talk about modes of transportation."}]}], "type": "sena"}